    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"Patient&#39;sAppointmentsSearch-Aboutthefeature:\">About the feature:</h2><p><span>Users would like to search for patients and view the list of appointments against a patient. Patient Search is available in list view of appointments. User can search for a patient by name or by ID. The search result is a list of all appointments against the patient. Currently filters are not available on this page. Actions can be performed on the appointments in the same way as the <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/299958294/List+View+of+Appointments\" data-linked-resource-id=\"299958294\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">List view</a>. </span></p><h2 id=\"Patient&#39;sAppointmentsSearch-Usedby\">Used by</h2><p><span>Providers can use this to view past and future appointments of a particular patient. </span></p><h2 id=\"Patient&#39;sAppointmentsSearch-Howisitused\">How is it used</h2><ul><li><span>In List View of appointments at the top right, there is a patient search field.</span></li></ul><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"436\" width=\"814\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.55.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524565793&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=814&amp;height=436\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.55.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524565793&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"299860202\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-11-24 at 12.55.34 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"299368645\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"2\" data-media-id=\"9a2477cc-eec9-4f42-b58b-320877c96d56\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.55.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524565793&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=814&amp;height=436 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.55.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524565793&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=814&amp;height=436 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><ul><li><span>On Searching the user, a list of all the appointments against that user will be shown.</span></li><li>The filters and navigations across days and to calendar view are disabled and there is a “Reset Search” link available to go back to the list view the user came from.</li></ul><p><br/></p><p><span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"370\" width=\"929\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.56.24%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524628517&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=370\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.56.24%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524628517&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"299335878\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-11-24 at 12.56.24 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"299368645\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"2\" data-media-id=\"b011af59-0b17-47a8-b258-b4cbe8eea0c7\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.56.24%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524628517&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1011&amp;height=403 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.56.24%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524628517&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=370 1x\"></span></span></p><ul><li><span>A user can perform all the configured actions on the appointment from patient search page.</span></li></ul><p><span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"423\" width=\"824\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.57.25%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524694259&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=824&amp;height=423\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.57.25%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524694259&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"299630796\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-11-24 at 12.57.25 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"299368645\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"2\" data-media-id=\"7fb0e8ab-d1da-4386-b20e-3544d6d24c1d\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.57.25%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524694259&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=824&amp;height=423 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299368645/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-24%20at%2012.57.25%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511524694259&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=824&amp;height=423 1x\"></span></span></p><ul><li><span>A user can also print the results of this page by clicking on the print button. </span>This print has the same configuration as the <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/137953307/Configure+Views+of+Appointments\" data-linked-resource-id=\"137953307\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">list view print</a> with additional date column added.</li><li>The column headers are also sortable both in both ascending order and descending order. A user can click on the column name and an arrow appears beside the name, representing the type of sort. An upward arrow represents ascending order and a downward arrow represents a descending arrow.</li></ul><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7c94265c-1e62-4f71-86cb-300771770fb4\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>On This Page</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"3e18af8c-c850-4338-89e9-e8e465f6bccd\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
